    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>10级 伏击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 元素界 魔法兽（气系）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 81；''重伤'' 40</span><span>''先攻'' +15</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 24，''强韧'' 21，''反射'' 23，''意志'' 22</span><span>''侦查'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''易伤'' 5 火焰</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 0，飞行 8（盘旋）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">风中幻影</div>\n<div class=description>该气元素每当在没有邻接敌人的情况下开始回合时便变成隐形。该隐形持续直到其下回合结<br>束或直到它攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}击打✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+15vs.AC<br>命中：2d8+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/close}}猖獗风暴✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近程冲击 3（冲击内所有敌人）+13vs.反射<br>命中：3d8+5 伤害，且如果目标在该攻击前看不见该气元素则它晕眩直到该气元素下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（水元素，气元素，火元素，地元素）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+16</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 20（+10）</span><span>''敏捷'' 22（+11）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+7）</span><span>''智力'' 5（+2）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 能理解荒神语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
